{"id":"4a7f2048e97042ca","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/881_组合范畴语法_CCG_逻辑.md","title":"881 组合范畴语法 CCG 逻辑","display":"881_组合范畴语法_CCG_逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"881-组合范畴语法-CCG-逻辑\">881 组合范畴语法 CCG 逻辑</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限基本范畴集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Word}\">\\(\\mathsf{Word}\\)</span> 为词项集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{At}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为句子范畴。范畴构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}\\)</span> 三个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span> 后，词典为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lex}:\\mathsf{Word}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Cat})\">\\(\\operatorname{Lex}:\\mathsf{Word}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Cat})\\)</span>。CCG 在后文把组合规则和类型提升规则加入应用规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-范畴与变量操作\">2. 范畴与变量操作</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\\in\\mathsf{Cat}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\\in\\mathsf{Cat}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A))=\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A))=\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fslash}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fslash}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bslash}(B[\\sigma],A[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bslash}(B[\\sigma],A[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CCG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CCG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-判断\">3. 判断</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}=\\mathsf{Word}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}=\\mathsf{Word}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\cdot v\">\\(u\\cdot v\\)</span>。判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Judg}=\\{u\\Rightarrow A:u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Judg}=\\{u\\Rightarrow A:u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n\\{(w)\\Rightarrow A:w\\in\\mathsf{Word},A\\in\\operatorname{Lex}(w)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n\\{(w)\\Rightarrow A:w\\in\\mathsf{Word},A\\in\\operatorname{Lex}(w)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-应用与组合规则\">5. 应用与组合规则</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Judg}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Judg}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下第 5 节与第 6 节每个规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow B);u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow B);u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow B),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow B),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>前向组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(B,C));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,C)):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(B,C));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,C)):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后向组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(C,B)),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(C,A)):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(C,B)),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(C,A)):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-类型提升\">6. 类型提升</h1>\n<p>定义类型提升规则族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow A);u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(\\operatorname{atm}(s),\\operatorname{bslash}(A,\\operatorname{atm}(s)))):u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow A);u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(\\operatorname{atm}(s),\\operatorname{bslash}(A,\\operatorname{atm}(s)))):u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow A);u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(\\operatorname{fslash}(\\operatorname{atm}(s),A),\\operatorname{atm}(s))):u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow A);u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(\\operatorname{fslash}(\\operatorname{atm}(s),A),\\operatorname{atm}(s))):u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-派生树\">7. 派生树</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\">\\(T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\\)</span>。定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 当且仅当：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(x)\\)</span> 无重复项；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in T\">\\(x,y\\in T\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(x)\\)</span> 中当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\prec x\">\\(y\\prec x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 不出现在任何子节点列中；\n每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne r\">\\(y\\ne r\\)</span> 恰出现在一个子节点列中；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无有向环；且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in T\">\\(y\\in T\\)</span> 都沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 的有限链到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>CCG 派生树是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span>，其中\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span>。若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(x)=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(x)=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\)</span>，则要求</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n=0\\wedge\\ell(x)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\n\\quad\\lor\\quad\n((\\ell(x_0),\\ldots,\\ell(x_{n-1}));\\ell(x))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n=0\\wedge\\ell(x)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\n\\quad\\lor\\quad\n((\\ell(x_0),\\ldots,\\ell(x_{n-1}));\\ell(x))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A)=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):\n\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}),\\\n\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg},\\\n\\ell(r)=u\\Rightarrow A,\\\n\\text{且上述局部条件对每个 }x\\in T\\text{ 成立}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A)=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):\n\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}),\\\n\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg},\\\n\\ell(r)=u\\Rightarrow A,\\\n\\text{且上述局部条件对每个 }x\\in T\\text{ 成立}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=(u\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(J=(u\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(J)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(J)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导性与接受关系\">8. 可导性与接受关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\\Longleftrightarrow u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\\operatorname{atm}(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\\Longleftrightarrow u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\\operatorname{atm}(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(u,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导判断集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\n=\n\\{u\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Judg}:u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\n=\n\\{u\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Judg}:u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\\)</span> 除前向、后向应用外，还显式包含前向、后向组合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;}\\)</span> 与两种类型提升 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>CCG 的规则差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Word},s,\\mathsf{Cat},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Str},\\mathsf{Judg},\\operatorname{Lex},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\operatorname{OrdTree},\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Word},s,\\mathsf{Cat},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Str},\\mathsf{Judg},\\operatorname{Lex},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{B&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{T&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\operatorname{OrdTree},\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CCG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 CCG 的句法类型派生；不含 lambda 语义、特征结构、概率模型或解析算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"881-组合范畴语法-CCG-逻辑","text":"881 组合范畴语法 CCG 逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-范畴与变量操作","text":"2. 范畴与变量操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-判断","text":"3. 判断","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理","text":"4. 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-应用与组合规则","text":"5. 应用与组合规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-类型提升","text":"6. 类型提升","level":1},{"id":"7.-派生树","text":"7. 派生树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性与接受关系","text":"8. 可导性与接受关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异","text":"9. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Word}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lex}:\\mathsf{Word}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Cat})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\\in\\mathsf{Cat}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A))=\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fslash}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bslash}(B[\\sigma],A[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CCG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Str}=\\mathsf{Word}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\cdot v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Judg}=\\{u\\Rightarrow A:u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CCG}}=\n\\{(w)\\Rightarrow A:w\\in\\mathsf{Word},A\\in\\operatorname{Lex}(w)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Judg}^{<\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Judg}^n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Judg}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Judg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{>}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow B);u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{<}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow B),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{B>}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow\\op